        "proof_strategy": "direct",
        "provenance": {
          "statement": "literature-derived",
          "proof": "ai-altered"
        },
        "statement": "The bosonic Fock creation and annihilation operators are closed mutually adjoint maximal sector maps with finite-particle graph cores and CCR; fermionic maps are bounded CAR operators.",
