        "statement": "For each h, the Segal field (a-dagger(h)+a(h))/sqrt(2) on finite particles is essentially self-adjoint with exact one-mode multiplication domain; its exponential vectors yield Weyl unitaries, relations, vacuum Gaussian and strong continuity.",
